# Trivy misconfiguration suppressions for this repo (intentional, documented).

# AVD-DS-0002 — the worker image builds on the shared worker-bridge base,
# which runs as root by design today (same as services-s-3 and services-dynamo-db):
# the runtime user is governed by the agent's worker pod securityContext and
# patches, not by a USER directive here. Revisit when the bridge ships a
# non-root variant.
AVD-DS-0002
